CustomIO for s2script

Derived from CS2-CustomIO 1.DZ.17.3 by DarkerZ [RUS]:
https://github.com/darkerz7/CS2-CustomIO
Reference commit: c2d8f95aa0fac92e5c8fb83677df797e5ed529a6

CS2-CustomIO's idea and input set come from CS2Fixes' custom mapping features
(https://github.com/Source2ZE/CS2Fixes, src/customio.cpp).

Modified 2026-11-07: ported from C#/CounterStrikeSharp to TypeScript/s2script;
uses s2script's native AcceptInput hook and entity and schema APIs. Strings
that upstream assigned through CounterStrikeSharp's schema setters are pooled by
spawning a scratch entity with the string as its name. Adds tests and packaging.

